  fullText: 'They have taken over the laboratory. Premou said that the military will\ncontinue
    all further investigations. I left with as much of my research\nas possible;
    I will not float idle while something so large is happening.\n\nWords can not
    express what I saw through the telescope. Find me at\nmy house as soon as you
    are able.                                                                                                                                                                                   '
